flowchart LR
  MIC[Microphone] --> CAP[Capture: mono, 16 kHz, high-pass]
  CAP -->|Level + spectrum| OVL[Overlay meter]
  CAP -->|Samples| VAD[Silero VAD]
  VAD -->|utterance| WRK[Worker: Whisper transcribe]
  WRK --> CLEAN[clean_transcript]
  CLEAN -->|partial| OVL
  CLEAN --> TXT[Take text]
  TXT -->|review on| ED[Overlay editor]
  ED -->|Ctrl+Enter| INS[insert_text]
  TXT -->|review off| LIVE[LiveTyper, word by word]
  LIVE --> APP[Focused application]
  INS --> APP
